                 in the view — it binds through VehicleStateModel (P1/S8 seam).
  i18n keys    : the source routes only t('common.off','Off') through t(); it HARDCODES every other word
                 ("Vehicle State", the 10 row labels, On/Active/Occupied/Empty/Enabled, "Live"). The native
                 port routes ALL of them through the facade (18 web-derived keys) so the Swift sources hold
                 ZERO English prose literals; unit symbols (km/h, mph) + the em-dash are SI/scale literals.
  Composition  : GlassPanel(ui) -> TSGlassPanel ; the rows are the web `flex justify-between` label/value rows.
  Header       : web <Activity/> "Vehicle State" + the `sseConnected` green pulsing "Live" pill -> the
                 freshness chip (Live = green pulsing dot via animate-pulse parity, Reduce-Motion respected),
                 generalised with the P4 stale/offline states + banner.
  Branches     : web renders its rows unconditionally; reproduced as the `data` body (all 10 rows always
                 render with their off/em-dash sentinels). Plus the P4 leaf contract: loading (skeleton),
                 empty (absent reading, ContentUnavailableView — never a blank box), error (QueryError peer
                 with Retry), and the stale/offline connection axis with one-shot stale auto-refresh.
  Lights       : High Beams On/Off (cyan-300 -> accent) ; Turn Signal `(x)||'Off'`, active `x && x!=='Off'`
                 shows the raw label (amber-300 -> warning) ; Hazards Active/Off (rose-300 -> danger).
  Driver/Keys  : Driver Seat Occupied/Empty (green-400 -> success) ; Paired Keys `(count)||'—'` (0/nil -> em-dash).
  Access Modes : Valet Enabled/Off (purple-400 -> chartSeriesPower) ; Service Active/Off (amber-400 -> warning) ;
                 Speed Limit = formatSpeed(current_speed_limit) when speed_limit_mode else t('common.off')
                 (cyan-300 -> accent) ; Center Display `(x)||'—'` ; HomeLink Devices `(count)||'—'`.
  Colour map   : ADR-006 semantic (not literal) — cyan->accent, amber->statusWarning, rose->statusDanger,
                 green->statusSuccess, purple->chartSeriesPower, off/inactive->textMuted, plain->textPrimary.

